    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d59">

                <pb facs="0061" n="55" sameAs="frus:frus1942v03/pg55"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">856B.20/25: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Vice Consul at Aruba</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Standish</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Aruba</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1942-01-12T19:00:00-04:30">January 12, 1942—7
                            p.m.</date>
                        <lb/> [Received January 13—1:46 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>15. A detachment Air Corps landed 10 a.m. today without incident. Dutch and
                    British cooperated fully.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Standish</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
